<title>HONG KONG: HSBC Financial sets warrants on Thai stocks basket.</title>
<headline>HSBC Financial sets warrants on Thai stocks basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>HSBC Financial Products Ltd said it is issuing up to 1.50 million European style composite call warrants on a basket of 10 Thai stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises:</p>
<p> Advanced Info Systems	     1 share</p>
<p> Bangkok Bank			  4 shares</p>
<p> Krung Thai Bank		     5 shares</p>
<p> PTT Exploration		     1 share</p>
<p> Siam Cement			   1 share</p>
<p> Siam Commercial Bank		1 share</p>
<p> Telecomasia			   8 shares</p>
<p> Thai Airways			  4 shares</p>
<p> Thai Farmers Bank		   4 shares</p>
<p> United Communications Ind	 1 share</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE   US$127.89	     PREMIUM    17.17 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE    US$3.32		 GEARING    4.14X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION     18 MTHS FROM ISSUE  LISTING    LONDON</p>
<p> NOTE	     MINIMUM TRADE SIZE 1,000 WARRANTS AND</p>
<p>		    MULTIPLES OF 500 THEREAFTER</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
